  ('73cf3516-836c-478a-a790-35b6270b9ae2', '892102a8-5a9e-42b7-a542-c4200755a6a3', 'registan-edtech-math-uzbek', 'donation', 'education', 'samarkand', 'Samarqand va Toshkent', '/images/projects/registan.jpg', 'uz', 95000000, 10000, 68, 'active', false, '2026-09-09T08:00:00.000Z', '2026-09-11T08:00:00.000Z', '6e12f795-69fe-43df-aade-2b0d80214059', '2026-09-12T08:00:00.000Z', now() + interval '14 days', '2026-09-02T08:00:00.000Z'),
  ('3107824e-03ea-4634-a63a-a6f273994879', '86361a3b-797e-4827-a46b-5652b846d9d3', 'andijan-mobility-electric-cargo', 'equity', 'technology', 'andijan', 'Andijon', '/images/projects/andijan-trike.jpg', 'uz', 420000000, 5000000, 82, 'active', true, '2026-09-05T08:00:00.000Z', '2026-09-07T08:00:00.000Z', '6e12f795-69fe-43df-aade-2b0d80214059', '2026-09-08T08:00:00.000Z', now() + interval '24 days', '2026-08-29T08:00:00.000Z');


Endi har biri 1 200 kv. metrlik uchta tijorat issiqxonasini qurmoqchimiz. Mablag'' po''lat karkas, polikarbonat, quyosh panellari va sug''orish uskunalariga ketadi.

Bu mushoraka loyihasi: sarmoyadorlar 5 yil davomida tekshirilgan sof foydaning 28 foizini har chorakda oladi. Zarar bo''lsa, u ham kiritilgan ulushga qarab taqsimlanadi. Muddat oxirida kooperativ a''zolari ulushni sotib olishi mumkin.', 'Farg''onada qishda harorat ba''zan -10°C gacha tushadi. Shuning uchun ikki qavatli issiqlik izolyatsiyasi va pellet isitgichlar o''rnatamiz. Yo''lda hosil buzilmasligi uchun vakuum qadoqlashdan foydalanamiz.'),
  ('9d4c480d-4f45-4f39-ad91-c4a1efa460b7', 'en', 'AgroSmart Fergana: Solar-Powered Hydroponic Greenhouses', 'High-yield, water-efficient drip greenhouse producing organic vegetables for Fergana and Tashkent markets.', 'AgroSmart Fergana is deploying automated climate-controlled hydroponic growing bays powered by rooftop solar collectors in Kuva district, Fergana. We reduce groundwater usage by 78% while doubling seasonal tomato and bell pepper yields.', 'The Fergana Valley is Uzbekistan''s agricultural heartland, yet changing precipitation patterns and traditional furrow irrigation have strained local water tables. AgroSmart combines closed-loop hydroponics with IoT soil moisture telemetry and localized solar power. 

Our prototype facility in Kuva has already completed two successful growing cycles with 0% chemical runoff. With this Musharakah equity campaign, we are constructing three commercial-scale 1,200 sq. meter greenhouses equipped with automated nutrient dosing and thermal shade curtains.

Under the Musharakah contract, investor capital directly funds the structural greenhouse steel, solar panels, and pumping infrastructure. 28% of net audited profits will be distributed quarterly to investors over a 5-year operating agreement, after which co-op members retain a structured buyout option.', 'Extreme winter temperatures in Fergana can occasionally dip below -10°C. We mitigate this through dual-layer thermal insulation and automated biomass pellet heaters alongside solar storage. Transit delays are mitigated via vacuum packaging protocols.'),
  ('e1419726-cc75-4e37-a75a-8219566f2ff7', 'uz', 'Samarqand atlas va kulolchilik ustaxonasi', '24 nafar usta to''quvchi va kulolga zamonaviy uskunalar, 18 nafar yosh shogirdga ish o''rgatamiz.', 'Samarqanddagi ustalar kooperativi tabiiy bo''yoqli ipak abrbandi matolar va an''anaviy kobalt sirli sopol buyumlar ishlab chiqarishni kengaytiradi hamda 18 nafar yosh shogird tayyorlaydi.', 'Qo''lda to''qilgan ipak atlas va sirli sopol — Buyuk ipak yo''lidan qolgan meros. Lekin ustalarda ko''pincha xom ipakni ulgurji sotib olish, tejamkor elektr pech olish va buyumni yaxshi qadoqlash uchun pul yetmaydi.

Kooperativimiz 24 nafar usta oilasini bitta ustaxonaga birlashtirdi. Marg''ilon pillasini to''g''ridan-to''g''ri olamiz va tutunsiz elektr pechga o''tamiz — eski sir retseptlari saqlanib qoladi.

Homiylar raqamlangan buyumlar oladi: qo''lda to''qilgan ipak ro''mol, usta muhri bosilgan sopol to''plam va Samarqanddagi ustaxonamizda master-klass.', 'Bir metr ipakni qo''lda to''qish 4–6 soat oladi. Mukofotlar o''z vaqtida yetishi uchun dastgohlarni 8 nafar katta usta o''rtasida taqsimladik.'),
  ('e1419726-cc75-4e37-a75a-8219566f2ff7', 'en', 'SilkRoad Artisan Studio: Preserving Samarkand Ikat & Ceramics', 'Supporting 24 generational master weavers and ceramicists with modern studio equipment and fair global logistics.', 'Empowering master craftsmen in Samarkand to scale natural-dyed silk abrbandi textiles and traditional cobalt ceramic wares while training 18 young apprentices.', 'Uzbekistan''s handmade silk ikat and glazed ceramics represent centuries of Silk Road heritage. However, master artisans frequently lack the working capital needed for bulk natural raw silk purchases, energy-efficient electric kilns, and secure packaging.

Our studio cooperative in Samarkand brings together 24 generational craftsmen under one modernized workspace. By pooling resources, we source top-grade Marghilan silk cocoons directly and introduce smokeless electric kilns that reduce carbon emissions while maintaining historic glaze formulations.

Backers receive bespoke, numbered artisan collector pieces: hand-woven pure silk scarves, authentic ceramic tableware sets stamped by the master, and invitation passes to our live masterclasses in the heart of Samarkand.', 'Hand-weaving each meter of silk requires 4-6 hours of master labor. We have distributed looms across 8 senior weavers to ensure all backer rewards ship strictly on schedule.'),
  ('6f3e75b3-a961-4c02-a15d-d768311a82dc', 'uz', 'Chilonzorda bolalar uchun bepul robototexnika laboratoriyasi', 'Toshkent davlat maktablarining 600 dan ortiq o''quvchisiga robototexnika va dasturlashni bepul o''rgatamiz.', 'Chilonzor tumanida ochiq laboratoriya: kam ta''minlangan oilalar farzandlari uchun robototexnika, 3D bosma va dasturlash bo''yicha bepul mashg''ulotlar.', 'Toshkentda minglab maktab o''quvchilari muhandis bo''lishni orzu qiladi. Ammo kavsharlash stansiyasi, osillograf va 3D printer bor to''garaklar ko''p oilalar uchun qimmat.

Chilonzordagi 320 kv. metrlik binoni laboratoriyaga aylantirmoqdamiz. Hokimiyat binoni bepul berdi. Mashg''ulotlar, uskunalar va murabbiylar — hammasi tekin.

Yig''ilgan pulning hammasi uskunaga ketadi: 20 ta Arduino/ESP32 ish joyi, 6 ta 3D printer, himoya vositalari va o''zbek hamda rus tilidagi o''quv qo''llanmalar.', 'Bolalar bilan ishlaganda uskunalar tez eskiradi. Byudjetning 15 foizi ehtiyot qismlarga ajratilgan. Kavsharlashdan oldin har bir o''quvchi xavfsizlik bo''yicha yo''riqnomadan o''tadi.'),
  ('6f3e75b3-a961-4c02-a15d-d768311a82dc', 'en', 'Tashkent Robotics: Community STEM Maker Lab for Youth', 'Equipping 600+ secondary students across Tashkent public schools with free micro-controller and robotics education.', 'A non-profit open-access maker laboratory in Chilanzar district offering free hands-on robotics, 3D printing, and IoT coding workshops for children from underprivileged families.', 'As Uzbekistan''s digital economy surges, tens of thousands of school students in Tashkent dream of becoming software engineers and hardware roboticists. However, quality maker spaces with oscilloscopes, soldering stations, and 3D prototyping tools are out of reach for many public school families.

Tashkent Robotics Lab is converting a 320 sq. meter municipal facility in Chilanzar into a community innovation hub. All workshops, hardware kits, and mentor sessions are provided 100% tuition-free.

Through this donation-based campaign, 100% of community contributions are spent on purchasing reusable hardware workstations: 20 Arduino/ESP32 coding benches, 6 high-precision 3D printers, safety gear, and curriculum materials in Uzbek and Russian.', 'Equipment wear and tear is common with young students. We have budgeted 15% spare parts and conduct mandatory lab safety orientations before students handle soldering equipment.'),
  ('34fae723-c786-42f9-af7b-50f70a21ada1', 'uz', 'Orol qurigan tubiga 50 000 saksovul', 'Mo''ynoqda tuzli changni to''xtatadigan saksovul to''sig''ini ekamiz: 13 000 so''m — bitta ko''chat.', 'Mo''ynoq tumanida chuqur ildizli qora saksovul ekib, qumni mustahkamlaymiz va tuzli chang bo''ronlarini kamaytiramiz.', 'Orol dengizi qurib, o''rnida Orolqum cho''li paydo bo''ldi. Har yili u yerdan havoga 75 million tonnadan ortiq tuz va chang ko''tariladi. Qora saksovulning ildizi 12 metr chuqurlikka boradi — qumni ushlab, namlikni saqlaydi.

Qoraqalpoq davlat universiteti olimlari bilan birga GPS yordamida egat ochib ekish usulini ishlab chiqdik. Og''ir sharoitda ham ko''chatlarning 82 foizi tutib ketadi.

Har 13 000 so''m bitta sertifikatlangan ko''chatni ekish va ikki yil parvarishlashga yetadi. Homiylar o''z uchastkasining GPS koordinatalari va har yili sun''iy yo''ldosh orqali o''simlik qoplami hisobotini oladi.', 'Erta bahordagi bo''ronlar yangi ko''chatlarni qum bilan ko''mib yuborishi mumkin. Shuning uchun ko''chatlarni tuzli shamoldan to''sadigan pog''onali kichik ariqlarga ekamiz.'),
  ('34fae723-c786-42f9-af7b-50f70a21ada1', 'en', 'Aral Oasis: Green Barrier Saxaul Reforestation', 'Planting 50,000 drought-resilient saxaul trees on the exposed Aralkum seabed in Karakalpakstan.', 'Combating toxic salt dust storms and desertification in Muynak district by establishing deep-rooted black saxaul tree barriers that stabilize soil and restore local biodiversity.', 'The retreat of the Aral Sea created the Aralkum Desert, which releases over 75 million tons of salt and fine mineral dust annually into Central Asian skies. Black saxaul (Haloxylon aphyllum) is a miraculous native desert plant whose roots penetrate up to 12 meters, binding sand dunes and capturing airborne moisture.

Our scientific team from Karakalpak State University has perfected automated GPS-guided furrow planting techniques that boast an 82% sapling survival rate under extreme conditions.

Every 13,000 UZS donated plants and monitors one certified saxaul sapling for two critical early years. Backers receive GPS coordinate certificates of their planted sector and annual satellite vegetative index (NDVI) verification reports.', 'Early spring storms can bury freshly planted seedlings. We plant in staggered micro-trenches that shield young stems from direct salt winds.'),
  ('ed6cc46b-3d95-4a28-a5eb-8fc7ca9fb538', 'uz', 'Zarafshon: quyosh energiyasida ishlaydigan meva omborlari', 'Navoiy va Buxoro bog''dorlari uchun 150 tonnalik sovutgichli omborlar — elektr tarmog''iga bog''liq emas.', 'Kichik fermerlar hosilni mavsumda arzonga sotib yubormasligi uchun bog''lar yonida quyosh energiyali sovutgich omborlar quramiz. To''lov — har bir yashik uchun.', 'Uzum, anor va o''rik yetishtiramiz, lekin kichik oilaviy xo''jaliklar hosilning 30 foizigacha qismini yo''qotadi. Saqlash joyi yo''qligi uchun terim paytida eng past narxda sotishga majbur bo''ladi.

Zarafshon vodiysida bog''lar yonida 150 tonnalik modulli sovutgich omborlar quramiz. Ular quyosh panellari va muzli issiqlik akkumulyatorida ishlaydi: elektr o''chsa ham ichkarida doim 0–4°C.

Bu mushoraka loyihasi: sarmoyadorlar ombor egalaridan biriga aylanadi va yashik saqlash hamda saralash xizmatlaridan tushgan tekshirilgan foydaning 26 foizini yiliga ikki marta oladi.', 'Uskunani chetdan olib kelish muddati o''zgarishi mumkin. Shuning uchun barcha sovutgich uskunalarini Toshkentdagi rasmiy distribyutorlar orqali, ishlab chiqaruvchi kafolati bilan oldik.'),
  ('ed6cc46b-3d95-4a28-a5eb-8fc7ca9fb538', 'en', 'Zarafshan Solar Cold Chain: Off-Grid Fruit Storage', '150-tonne solar-powered refrigerated hubs for grape and pomegranate growers in Navoi & Bukhara.', 'Eliminating harvest-season fruit price collapses by providing smallholder horticultural farmers with decentralized, solar-powered cold storage facilities on a pay-per-crate model.', 'Uzbekistan produces some of the world''s sweetest table grapes, pomegranates, and dried apricots. Yet small family farms frequently lose up to 30% of their crop to spoilage or are forced to sell at rock-bottom wholesale prices during peak picking weeks due to a lack of cold storage.

Zarafshan Solar Cold Chain builds modular 150-tonne cold storage facilities directly adjacent to rural orchards along the Zarafshan river basin. Running on high-capacity solar PV with thermal ice-battery storage, our units maintain a constant 0°C to 4°C with zero reliance on erratic rural electrical grids.

Under this Musharakah equity campaign, investors co-own the physical storage facility and earn 26% of audited crate storage fees and value-added sorting/packaging revenues, distributed bi-annually.', 'Equipment import lead times can be unpredictable. We have sourced all core refrigeration units through authorized regional distributors in Tashkent with full manufacturer warranties.'),
  ('c425ad3b-ebfc-49d6-a8a7-d237cc54b3c3', 'uz', 'Chust pichog''i: qo''lda toblangan damask po''lat', 'Chust pichoqchilik an''anasini damask po''lat bilan boyitamiz — oshxona va kolleksiya uchun.', 'Namangan viloyati Chust shahridagi 12 nafar usta pichoqchiga gidravlik bolg''a va jilolash uskunalari olib beramiz.', 'Chust pichog''i jez naqshi va shox dastasi bilan butun dunyoga mashhur. Asrlar davomida ular qo''lda, bolg''a bilan toblanib keladi.

Bugungi oshxonada raqobatlashish uchun ustalarimiz an''anaviy Chust dastasini ko''p qatlamli, yuqori uglerodli damask po''lat bilan birlashtirmoqda.

Homiylar har biri raqamlangan, qo''lda yasalgan pichoq oladi: oshxona pichog''i, osh uchun an''anaviy pichoq va Chust ustalari tikkan charm g''ilof.', 'Har bir pichoq qo''lda yasaladi, shuning uchun damask naqshi va yog''och tolasi biroz farq qiladi — bu haqiqiy qo''l mehnatining belgisi.'),
  ('c425ad3b-ebfc-49d6-a8a7-d237cc54b3c3', 'en', 'Chust Pichoq: Heritage Hand-Forged Damascus Knives', 'Modernizing Chust traditional bladesmithing with Damascus steel folding and Damascus Damascus kitchen sets.', 'Equipping 12 generational bladesmiths in Chust, Namangan with hydraulic power-hammers and ergonomic Damascus blade finishing for chefs and collectors worldwide.', 'Chust in Namangan region is world-renowned for traditional Uzbek "pichoq" knives with brass inlays and horn handles. For centuries, these knives have been hand-hammered with incredible sharpness.

To compete in modern culinary markets and withstand dishwasher use, our guild is combining historic Chust horn handle aesthetics with high-carbon multi-layered Damascus steel folding.

Backers receive individually serialized, hand-forged chef santokus, traditional plov paring knives, and custom leather sheaths crafted by Chust master artisans.', 'Each knife is shaped by hand, so slight variations in Damascus grain and wood swirls will exist, reflecting genuine artisan uniqueness.'),
  ('73cf3516-836c-478a-a790-35b6270b9ae2', 'uz', 'Registon: o''zbek tilida moslashuvchan matematika', '5–11-sinflar uchun davlat dasturiga mos, o''yin shaklidagi matematika ilovasi.', '10 000 dan ortiq masala, o''zbek tilidagi animatsion video darslar va 50 ta davlat maktabi uchun avtomatik bilim tekshiruvi.', 'Xorijiy matematika ilovalari ko''p, lekin ular O''zbekiston maktab dasturiga mos emas va o''zbek tilida tabiiy gapirmaydi.

Registon arzon Android telefonlarda ham, sekin internetda ham bemalol ishlaydigan yengil ilova yaratmoqda. O''qituvchi har bir o''quvchi qaysi mavzuni o''zlashtirganini real vaqtda ko''radi.

Bu notijorat loyiha: Samarqand, Qashqadaryo va Surxondaryo qishloqlaridagi 12 000 nafar o''quvchi ilovadan bepul foydalanadi.', 'Qishloq maktablarida internet tez-tez uziladi. Ilova internetsiz ishlaydi va natijalarni aloqa tiklanganda sinxronlaydi.'),
  ('73cf3516-836c-478a-a790-35b6270b9ae2', 'en', 'Registan EdTech: Adaptive Math in Uzbek Language', 'Gamified digital mathematics platform tailored for grades 5–11 aligned with Uzbekistan national curriculum.', 'An interactive online learning system offering 10,000+ bilingual math challenges, animated video lessons in Uzbek, and automated mastery diagnostics for 50 public schools.', 'While international math apps exist, few are mapped directly to Uzbekistan''s national school curriculum or narrated in natural Uzbek terminology with culturally relatable scenarios.

Registan EdTech creates a clean, lightweight web and mobile app that runs smoothly even on entry-level Android phones with low internet bandwidth. Teachers receive real-time class dashboards showing student topic mastery.

This non-profit initiative will grant 100% free digital subscriptions to 12,000 public school students across rural Samarkand, Kashkadarya, and Surkhandarya regions.', 'Rural schools frequently face spotty internet. Our application is architected as an offline-first PWA that synchronizes progress only when connectivity is restored.'),
  ('3107824e-03ea-4634-a63a-a6f273994879', 'uz', 'Andijon: uch g''ildirakli elektr yuk mototsikllari', 'Bozor savdogarlari va fermerlar uchun Andijonda yig''ilgan elektr yuk mototsikllari.', 'Shovqinli, benzin yeydigan yuk mototsikllari o''rniga oddiy 220V rozetkadan bir kechada quvvatlanib, 600 kg yuk tashiydigan elektr mototsikllar.', 'Bozorlarda va dehqon xo''jaliklarida uch g''ildirakli yuk mototsikllari meva-sabzavot, mato va non tashishda juda muhim. Ammo benzin va tez-tez ta''mirlash haydovchilarga qimmatga tushadi.

Andijon Mobility mahalliy po''lat rama va litiy-temir-fosfat batareyali elektr mototsikllar yasaydi. Bir kilometr yo''l benzinli mototsikldan 80% arzonga tushadi.

Bu mushoraka loyihasi: Andijonda 200 ta mototsikl yig''adigan liniya quramiz. Sarmoyadorlar mototsikl sotuvi va batareya almashtirish xizmatidan tushgan sof foydaning 24 foizini oladi.', 'Batareya elementlarini olib kelish temir yo''l kechikishlariga bog''liq bo''lishi mumkin. Andijondagi omborimizda 60 kunlik zaxira saqlaymiz.'),
  ('3107824e-03ea-4634-a63a-a6f273994879', 'en', 'Andijan Mobility: Modular Electric Cargo Trikes', 'Locally assembled electric utility vehicles for bazaar traders and agricultural delivery in the Fergana Valley.', 'Replacing noisy, petrol-guzzling tricycles with clean, whisper-quiet electric cargo tricycles capable of hauling 600kg on a single overnight charge from regular 220V wall outlets.', 'Throughout Uzbekistan''s bustling bazaars and smallholder farms, small three-wheeled petrol cargo bikes are vital for moving produce, textiles, and bread. However, fuel costs and frequent maintenance weigh heavily on drivers.

Andijan Mobility manufactures purpose-built, heavy-duty electric cargo trikes using domestically stamped steel frames and automotive-grade lithium iron phosphate (LiFePO4) battery packs. Our vehicles cost 80% less to operate per kilometer than petrol equivalents.

With this Musharakah equity round, we are tooling an assembly line in Andijan to produce 200 commercial trikes. Investors share 24% of net vehicle sales and subscription battery-swap service profits.', 'Battery cell import lead times can be subject to rail transport delays. We maintain a 60-day strategic buffer stock in our Andijan warehouse.');





